            "review_title": "Review at Sunset Story",
            "review_text": "Sandie C\n2 contributions\n0\nFabulous location, delicious food, friendly staff. What more could you want!?!\nJan 2026 • Family\nWow! This place is a hidden gem! \nThe location is special, and the food outstanding!\nWe’ve eaten at many local restaurants during our 3 week stay, but Sunset Story stands out by a mile.\nStaff are friendly, service was impeccable, and the food is best quality.\nIf I could give 10 stars I would.\nInsider tip:\nBeef in green pepper sauce is so delicious! The portions are a good size, and all arrives quickly and piping hot!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 25, 2026",
