            "review_text": "하이제이 Hi - J\nSeoul, South Korea685 contributions\n0\nFuzhou Seafood Cuisine, Sunset Cuisine Sunset Stories Restaurant\nJul 2025\nDuring a trip to Fuzhou, I visited the seafood restaurant.\nThe Sunset Story Restaurant in Puyok North!!\nDelicious and delicious gold barry and crayfish, tigershaw and fries, morning glory, and shinshaw.\nAll the food was delicious.\nIt's Vietnamese, but the restaurant looks far to Cambodia.\nThe best sunset in Fuegook that I could see was a beautiful, delicious restaurant.\nRead more\nTranslated from Korean\nShow original\nWritten August 8, 2025",
