            "review_text": "Daydream30723993997\n1 contribution\n0\nPerfect dinner spot for our family holiday\nJul 2025 • Family\nWe came to Sunset Story with three generations grandparents, us, and our two kids and everyone loved it!\n\nThe seafood was incredibly fresh, especially the garlic butter lobster and the fried squid with fish sauce. Even the kids enjoyed the crispy rice and scallops. The staff were very sweet and helped us get a table with the best sunset view.\n\nThey picked us up directly from our hotel in Grand World, which made everything super easy. The sunset was magical, and the sound of the waves made the whole evening feel like a dream.\n\nThank you Sunset Story for a lovely memory during our trip to Phu Quoc!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 9, 2025",
